  "lyrics": {
    "official": true,
    "language": "english",
    "text": "[Chorus — bright, warm, layered harmonies]\nI asked you to be my lady\nYou first said, \"Maybe\"\nNow you can't stop callin' me baby\nNow you can't stop callin' me baby\nI asked you to be my lady\nYou kept drivin' me crazy\nNow every time my phone lights up\nGirl, it's always \"Baby\"\n\n[Verse 1 — conversational, confident]\nBack then I was all in, you played it cool\nSlow replies like I had somethin' to prove\nNow the vibe done switched, ain't that funny\nSame smile, different energy\nYou see me outside, livin' life lately\nNow you wonder why I'm movin' so wavy\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nNo hard feelings, no bad blood\nGuess we both just grew, that's what's up\n\n[Chorus — biggest, sweetest version, full harmony stack]\nI asked you to be my lady\nYou first said, \"Maybe\"\nNow you can't stop callin' me baby\nNow you can't stop callin' me baby\n\n[Verse 2 — smile starts slipping, pads detune slightly]\nNow it's \"Where you at?\"\nNow it's \"Can we talk?\"\nNow it's \"Come through\" every other call\nFunny what a little confidence do\nFunny what a little— hold up, that's you?\nForty-seven missed, and it's quarter past two\nCar outside runnin', how you know my new—\n\n[The Flip — beat cuts out, room goes dry, minor key]\nUsed to chase you\nNow you chase me\nFor real\nSomebody come and saaaave me\n\n[Verse 3 — dark, sparse, sub bass distorted, no hi-hats]\nYou know my mama's number, you ain't never met my mama\nYou know the door code, and I changed the door code\nLeft a plate in my kitchen, went and folded up my laundry\nThat ain't sweet, that's a warning, that's a warning\n\n[Bridge — minor, haunted, reverb-drenched]\n\"Maybe\" was the right answer then\n'Cause if you'd said no\nWe wouldn't be here now\nFunny how the timing changed\nNow you know my name\nYou know my name\nNow you know my name\nYou know my name\nYou know too much of my name\n\n[Final Chorus — half-time, same melody, sinister harmonies, panicked ad-libs]\nI asked you to be my lady\n(Pick up, pick up, pick up)\nYou first said, \"Maybe\"\n(Please, pick up)\nNow you can't stop callin' me baby\nNow you can't stop callin' me baby\nFunny how life changes\nFunny how love changes\nYesterday was \"Maybe\"\nToday it's \"Baby\"\nTomorrow I ain't answerin' —",
    "lrc": "[Intro]\n[Chorus]\n[00:18.50] I asked you to be mine, you first said mate\n[00:23.43] Now you can't stop callin' me,\n[00:26.01] now you can't stop callin' me\n[00:28.21] I asked you to be my lady\n[00:31.82] You kept driving me crazy\n[00:33.49] Now every time my phone lights up\n[00:36.68] Girl,\n[00:37.32] it's all awake, baby\n[Verse 1]\n[00:39.20] Back then I was all in, you played it cool\n[00:42.02] Slow replies like I had something to prove\n[00:44.52] Now the vibe done switched\n[00:45.82] Ain't that funny, same smile\n[00:48.30] Different energy, you see me outside\n[00:50.92] Living life lately\n[00:52.06] Now you wonder why I'm moving so wavy\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[00:54.70] No hard feelings, no bad blood\n[00:56.96] I guess we both just grew, that's what's up\n[Chorus]\n[00:59.36] I asked you to be my lady\n[01:02.10] You first said maybe\n[01:03.44] Now you can't stop calling me baby\n[01:05.90] Now you can't stop calling me baby\n[01:09.26] Now it's, where you at?\n[01:10.88] Now it's, can we talk?\n[01:12.20] Now it's, come through\n[01:13.22] Every other call\n[01:14.54] Funny what a little confidence do\n[01:16.92] Funny what a little, hold up, that's you\n[01:19.46] 47 missed in this quarter past two\n[01:22.02] Car outside running, how you know my name?\n[01:24.56] Used to chase you, now you chase me\n[01:26.66] For real, somebody come and save me\n[01:29.52] You know my momma number\n[01:30.70] You ain't never been my momma\n[01:32.08] You know the door code\n[01:33.22] And I changed the door code\n[01:34.48] Left a plate in my kitchen\n[01:35.78] Went and folded all my laundry\n[01:37.06] That ain't sweet, that's a warning\n[01:38.38] That's a warning\n[01:39.66] Baby,\n[01:41.98] what's the right answer then?\n[01:44.70] Cause if you said no\n[01:47.56] We wouldn't be here now\n[Verse 2]\n[01:49.50] Funny how the time ain't changed\n[01:53.84] Now you know my name\n[01:55.16] You know my name\n[01:56.46] You know my name\n[01:57.68] You know too much of my name\n[01:59.36] I'm passionate about you, baby\n[02:01.16] Pick up, pick up\n[02:02.12] Who first said, baby?\n[02:03.38] Pick up\n[02:03.98] Now you can't stop calling me baby\n[The Flip]\n[02:05.99] Now you can't stop calling me baby\n[02:08.50] I'm passionate about you\n[Verse 3]\n[02:10.38] Life changes\n[02:10.96] Funny how love changes\n[02:13.62] Yesterday was baby\n[02:15.86] Today is baby\n[02:18.34] Tomorrow I ain't answering\n[Bridge]\n[02:26.46] And I need peace, baby\n[02:27.73] Please don't leave\n"
  },
