        },
        {
          "name": "The Flip",
          "interpretation": "In this pivotal moment of silence, the lyrics strip away all pretense to reveal that the hunter has become the hunted, with a desperate plea for rescue.",
          "keyLine": "\"Used to chase you / Now you chase me\""
        },
        {
          "name": "Verse 3",
          "interpretation": "The horror of being known too deeply is laid bare through specific details like knowing the door code and having left personal items behind, signaling a breach of safety.",
          "keyLine": "\"That ain't sweet, that's a warning, that's a warning\""
